9},"Open the complete game project","https://github.com/chongdashu/phaserjs-tinyswords","Full public/index.html game, Tiny Swords assets, PRD, technical design and UI test harness are included. Open public/index.html in a modern browser. No root LICENSE was found; artwork retains Pixel Frog terms. Do not assume unrestricted reuse.","Access type","playable","Play or run",[194],{"_51":195,"_26":196,"_180":197},"Play Castle Clash Duel","https://vibe-tiny-swords.vercel.app/","Author-linked browser prototype with mouse or touch controls. The local public/index.html loads Phaser 3.70.0 from a CDN.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[205],{"_51":206,"_26":158,"_180":-7},"Read the PRD-to-game workflow","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[211,212,213,214],"Play a two-player battle and identify recruitment, movement, attacks and castle victory conditions.","Read the published PRD and technical design before tracing the game’s single-file scene logic.","Inspect the Tiny Swords asset metadata and the custom panels used to handle sprite padding.","Change one unit or UI rule with an agent, then replay the battle and inspect the included test harness.","AI workflow / foundation context","The creator combined a PRD, technical design and curated asset metadata with three Claude Code skills for Phaser gameplay, tilemaps and frontend testing. Human-made Tiny Swords assets are credited separately; this is a prototype.","aiUse","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","Engine","ai-assisted",[211,212,213,214],{"_51":206,"_26":158,"_18":232},{"_51":195,"_26":196,"_18":191,"_180":197},{"_51":187,"_26":188,"_180":189,"_230":231},{"_51":179,"_26":158,"_180":181},[229,117],"claude-code","scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_234":235},"documents",{"_236":237,"_238":239},"en",[241,245,246,247,244,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,27